# HRMS Application — Modern Futuristic UI Overhaul

Complete visual redesign of the HRMS application from a basic, unstyled white UI to a premium, dark-mode futuristic interface with glassmorphism, gradient accents, smooth animations, contextual SVG icons, and a persistent sidebar navigation.

