| Input BG | `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` |

### Icons
Every module card and page header will have contextual **inline SVG icons** (no external library needed). Each icon is unique to the module:

| Module | Icon |
|--------|------|
| Dashboard | Grid/squares layout |
| Employees | Person group |
| Attendance | Clock/check |
| Leave | Calendar with arrow |
| Payroll | Wallet/money |
| Payslips | Receipt/document |
| Projects | Folder/briefcase |
| Timesheet | Clipboard/timer |
| Overtime | Clock with plus |
| Permissions | Shield/lock |
| Admin Dashboard | Chart bar |
| Settings | Gear |
| Users | Person |

### Animations & Micro-interactions
- **Card hover**: `translateY(-4px)` lift with glow shadow
- **Page load**: `fadeInUp` animation with staggered delay
- **Button hover**: subtle brightness increase + shadow glow
- **Status badges**: soft pulse for "PENDING" items
- **Sidebar**: smooth slide transitions on active state
- **Loading**: animated gradient shimmer skeleton
- **Modals**: fade + scale-up entrance

### Layout
- **Sidebar** (fixed left, 260px wide): Persistent navigation with logo, nav links, user info, logout
- **Main content**: Right-side scrollable area with `padding: 2rem`
- All pages except login share the sidebar layout via a shared wrapper pattern in each page

