## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run dev` and verify no build errors
- Browser test: Navigate to login → login → verify dashboard renders → navigate to each module page

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of all 15 pages via browser screenshots
- Verify responsive layout
- Confirm all existing functionality still works (login, navigation, API calls)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No backend changes** — this is a purely frontend visual overhaul. All API calls, business logic, and routing remain identical. Only the JSX markup and inline styles are updated.

> [!NOTE]
> The admin, manager, and employee dashboard pages currently use Tailwind-style `className` props but Tailwind is NOT installed. These pages likely render with broken/unstyled content. The redesign will fix this by converting everything to inline styles + CSS classes from our globals.css.
